# CS2 — API & queue

## Steam account

```http
POST /api/steam/connect
GET /api/steam/accounts
DELETE /api/steam/accounts/:id
```

## Match tracking

```http
POST /api/match-tracking/setup
POST /api/match-tracking/sync-now
GET /api/match-tracking/status
```

## Matches

```http
GET /api/matches
GET /api/matches/:matchId
GET /api/matches/:matchId/stats
GET /api/matches/:matchId/events
GET /api/matches/:matchId/timeline-markers
GET /api/matches/:matchId/analysis
```

## Video

```http
GET /api/matches/:matchId/video
GET /api/matches/:matchId/video/signed-url
GET /api/matches/:matchId/highlights
POST /api/matches/:matchId/highlights/:highlightId/render
```

Implement dưới `src/app/api/` (App Router Route Handlers). Giai đoạn đầu: interface + mock adapter cho Steam/parser.

## Job types

```text
fetch-latest-matches
download-demo
parse-demo
generate-analysis
generate-video-markers
render-highlight-video
```

## Job flow

```text
fetch-latest-matches
  -> download-demo
  -> parse-demo
  -> generate-video-markers
  -> generate-analysis
```

Phase sau:

```text
generate-analysis -> render-highlight-video
```

## Retry policy

```text
fetch-latest-matches:
  retry 3, backoff 1m, 5m, 15m

download-demo:
  retry 5, backoff tăng dần

parse-demo:
  retry 2; lỗi format → failed (không retry vô hạn)

render-highlight-video:
  retry 2, timeout rõ
```

Queue: Redis + BullMQ. Workers tách process khỏi Next.js (Railway/Fly/VPS).
